WEBVTT

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.160
Grandpa...

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.140
Grandpa Shichuu...

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:24.250
Grandpa Shichuu!

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:23.930
Huh?

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.630
Damn it. What's with this guy?

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.290
You're not getting away!

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.230
Come here!

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.110
Kourei Kenshou...

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.660
Hahou... sei... fuurei...

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:01.790
San!

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:07.590
Grandpa Shichuu, I'm sorry.

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:23.290
Bastard!

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.140
You brat!

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:28.350
How could you do that?

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.900
That old man was mine!

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.160
I'll kill you!

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:33.330
I'll kill you!

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.660
I'll kill you!

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:36.960
I'll kill you!

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:42.510
What are you doing?

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:43.990
Do you want to die, too?

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:47.530
Your opponent has lost all will to fight.

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:50.030
Therefore, the match is over.

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:51.370
You've won.

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:58.600
If you're still not satisfied, 
then I'll take you on.

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:02.160
Fine. I'll kill you and—

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:10.960
Then it's safe to assume the match is over?

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:13.150
D-Don't get full of yourself!

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:17.450
You Tenshifu bastards are just 
my great-grandfather's flunkies!

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:20.120
You pieces of shit.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:21.500
You'll pay for this!

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:26.540
The match is over.

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:29.300
Ou Hei wins!

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:33.700
And that's how Fuu Shinton was defeated.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.400
That's odd, though.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.240
I thought Kourei Kenshou was a secret 
art that only the Fuu family could use.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:44.430
How was Ou Ai's great-grandson using it?

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:47.050
Since it's one of eight secret arts,

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:50.550
they wouldn't have carelessly taught 
it to someone outside the family.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:53.120
How did Ou Hei acquire it?

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:54.690
There!

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.330
He got away.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.930
H-Hou-nee!

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:00.480
Huh?

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.540
You can't just suddenly throw 
knives around out here!

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:04.990
What if you'd hit me?!

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:08.670
But a suspicious figure was 
eavesdropping on our conversation.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:09.390
I had to.

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:10.940
A suspicious figure?

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:14.330
Houhou, did you really sense someone?

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:18.750
Yeah, I'm sure. Probably 
an exceptional master.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:24.190
The moment I drew my 
knife, they disappeared.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.630
I see.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.070
They've finally appeared.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.110
Who are you talking about?

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.480
Have you forgotten?

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:36.740
Those scoundrels are the only ones I can 
think of who'd do something this sneaky.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:41.980
The Tenshi's position, the Tsuutenroku, 
and the eight secret arts.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:46.510
They're desperate to get 
their hands on all of them.

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:49.710
We'll have to be more careful from now on.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:26.720
<b>13: Kourei Kenshou</b>

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:31.660
Ou Ai-sama, why is a member of the Ou family

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:43.530
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.960
using the Fuu family's Kourei Kenshou?

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.670
Please explain.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:42.220
Calm down, Chairman Fuu.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:49.910
We learned Kourei Kenshou 
from your grandfather.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:52.200
That's not possible.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.850
Think about it.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:06:01.800
How had Chou Kaigi, another user of one 
of eight secret arts, been living his life?

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:07.390
He lived secretly in hiding for a long time.

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:13.410
In contrast, the Fuu family 
lives boldly out in the open.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.140
Do you know why?

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:21.510
Because my father defended the 
Fuu family during the Koushin War.

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:29.020
This is a good opportunity to tell you the 
secret concerning the Fuu and Ou families.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:36.150
At the time, your grandfather Fuu 
Tenyou was captured by the Ou family.

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:41.160
Surprisingly enough, he was a coward.

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:46.000
He begged my father to spare 
his life countless times.

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:51.050
My father took pity on him and 
spared him in exchange for

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.410
the Fuu family's Kourei Kenshou.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:56.650
He even promised to smooth things 
over between the Fuu family

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:59.470
and the heads of the other styles.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:04.760
Fuu Tenyou readily handed over Kourei Kenshou

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:09.960
and even swore not to pass on to his 
descendants the complete Kourei Kenshou.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:14.320
As the ones who saved their lives,

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:17.580
the Fuu family knelt before the Ou family.

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:22.760
When he confessed the names of the 
masters of the rest of the secret arts,

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:26.680
the heads also decided 
to forgive Fuu Tenyou.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:32.720
Then they set their sights on the 
seven remaining secret arts.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:39.740
They must have noticed the deal 
between my father and Fuu Tenyou.

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:42.110
You know, don't you?

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.280
It's an unspoken agreement.

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:51.900
If you capture the successor to a 
secret art, it becomes your own.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:56.530
No one ever told me this.

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:03.910
It's still the greatest secret 
in the world of outsiders.

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:08.390
After that, Fuu Tenyou retired.

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:11.500
Or rather, he went into hiding out of fear.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:17.640
Either way, he was a coward, but as promised,

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:22.350
he hasn't passed on the complete 
Kourei Kenshou to his descendants.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:25.980
Perhaps he was a man of his word.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:28.370
But now you understand.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:32.320
You owe your current 
success to your grandfather

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:36.450
desperately bowing his 
head to the Ou family.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:40.590
I doubt your grandfather told you that.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:49.760
What are you doing, Chairman Fuu?

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:56.600
We've been indebted to the Ou family 
this whole time without realizing it.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:03.370
I thought we were made members of 
the Ten Elders because of our strength.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:09.640
I look down upon the Fuu family 
from the bottom of my heart.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:13.690
Doing that now won't change anything.

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:15.350
Of course not.

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:19.740
I'm ashamed of the disgraceful 
way I've behaved until now.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:25.010
I'm kneeling now not to apologize to you,

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:32.460
but to express gratitude to your father 
for protecting the Fuu family.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.840
Ou Ai-sama, please remember this.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:45.480
From this day forward, I will act 
according to your instructions.

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:52.890
Now, now. Raise your head, Chairman Fuu.

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:55.980
You don't need to go that far.

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:58.920
I just told you an old story.

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:02.320
No, I appreciate your guidance. Thank you.

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.540
Nothing strange over here.

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:08.930
The detector isn't responding.

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:12.640
Hana-chan, are you sure 
these devices are enough?

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:15.340
<i>Don't underestimate my intelligence, fatass.</i>

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:19.140
These devices detect any 
ki within a given area.

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:22.170
If we place these around the arena,

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:25.300
we'll know when any outsiders 
leave or enter the area.

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:28.550
We don't need to worry about anyone leaving,

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:32.270
<i>but with the end of the 
tournament approaching,</i>

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:35.880
<i>anyone entering the grounds is suspicious.</i>

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:39.310
<i>Report them as soon as you find them.</i>

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:42.320
Stay on your guard until the end.

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.580
Roger that.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.870
Got one already, huh?

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.600
I'd better tell the others.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:01.640
Who are you?

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:07.500
Hello. We are friends of the Tenshi.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:11.660
Please take us to the Tenshi.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:12.360
Thank you.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.800
<i>You heard him. What should I do?</i>

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.780
<i>I don't speak English.</i>

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:22.880
Uh... if they're the Tenshi's friends, 
why not take them to him?

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:27.030
And call Rikukin-sama and 
Den Shinchuu-sama just in case.

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:28.090
<i>Got it.</i>

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:30.470
Rinron, let's go.

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:33.990
But I wanted to watch 
Soran and Houhou's match.

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:35.150
Too bad.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:39.140
After all, those two strong guys 
are going to fight each other.

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:41.780
I'm sure it'll be an amazing match.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:46.180
You're quite the idiot, aren't you?

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.940
Huh? What do you mean?

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:54.660
You still don't know why Fuu Houhou's 
participating in the tournament?

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:59.350
The Raten Taishou semi-final 
matches will now begin.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.280
Chou Soran versus Fuu Houhou.

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:06.820
Chou Reigyoku versus Ou Hei.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:10.270
May luck be on your side.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:13.730
Let the matches begin!

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:17.330
Let's go, Hou-nee.

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:18.460
Bring it on.

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:28.140
Fuu Houhou, die!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:33.400
Chou Soran, I will take your life!

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:53.210
Oh, no!

00:12:55.970 --> 00:12:58.790
Wow, Chou Soran is amazing.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.430
I don't stand a chance against him.

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:02.950
I lost. Ugh...

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.380
Chou Soran versus Fuu Houhou!

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:09.390
Chou Soran wins!

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:15.140
By the way, everyone...

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:22.880
The Tenshifu is not concerned with 
anything that happens after the match.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:25.440
Feel free to do whatever you please.

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:30.880
Huh? What does that mean?

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:39.470
How could we keep our mouths 
shut after that farce?

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:42.250
You're shameless!

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:49.950
Hou-nee, stop playing dead! Let's run!

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:54.010
I can't believe they saw 
through our brilliant acting.

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:55.930
How was that brilliant?

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:59.120
Damn it! You ruined my amazing performance!

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.170
It's over.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:04.630
Our company's image is ruined...

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:10.310
Our image wasn't that good to begin with.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:11.660
Anyway...

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:16.960
I can't believe Soran actually 
made it to the finals.

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:21.560
I wasn't expecting you two to come.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.870
Please, come in.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:27.930
You're as energetic as ever, Tenshi.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:32.050
Who knew the Tenshi had foreign friends?

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.430
Did you, shorty?

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.740
No. I'm just a servant.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:40.980
And my name isn't shorty. It's Hane.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:42.930
Okay, short stuff.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.330
It's Hane.

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:50.230
But why did they come just 
before the tournament's end?

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:55.820
Rikukin, Shinchuu.
Allow me to introduce you.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:59.280
This is Isaac Tambor-sensei,

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:04.180
the headmaster of Flamel Academy 
in England, and his friend.

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:09.210
I met them a few years ago 
when I was visiting Europe.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:15.310
So that's why you made such a fuss about 
learning English for a while there.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:20.200
There was a lot I wanted to 
learn from Tambor-sensei.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:24.940
He's a man of incredible power.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:29.820
Hey, Hane-chan. Bring our guests some tea.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:33.440
F-Forgive me! I'll bring some immediately...

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.930
Now this is interesting.

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:53.510
This is my first time seeing the 
kung fu of Western outsiders.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:56.370
We are not outsiders.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:16:00.010
Don't assume we're like you.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:06.910
U-Uh, I'll be going now.

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:11.520
I hadn't introduced him yet.

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:18.510
He is a magic teacher at Victor 
Academy and my greatest student.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:22.370
Sensei, may I have a moment?

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:24.010
Ah, okay.

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:33.550
You didn't come here to cause a 
commotion at the tournament, did you?

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:36.310
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:39.130
I have no intention of doing that.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.010
While traveling the world,

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:48.300
I heard you were holding a tournament 
and decided to stop by. That's all.

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:53.000
There's also something I'd 
like to discuss with you.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.320
Discuss?

00:16:57.090 --> 00:17:00.750
Ah, I see.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:09.010
But Sensei, our situation isn't much better.

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:11.980
I'm sure we'd disappoint you.

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:18.120
It seems we have the same problem.

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:25.530
Setting the issue aside for now, 
why don't you stay here tonight?

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:29.490
Oh? Will there be some kind of event?

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:33.320
Tomorrow is the final 
match of the tournament.

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:38.320
The winner will become my successor.

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:41.520
I'd like you to see it.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:47.800
<i>I am the successor to the 
Ou family, one of Ten Elders.</i>

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:49.600
<i>A hero of the times.</i>

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.970
<i>People have disliked me since I was a child.</i>

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:56.160
Oh, wow!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:18:00.250
These are all official 
copies, not pirated ones!

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:01.560
Pirated copies?

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:04.010
Why would I buy those?

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:08.150
B-But aren't the official 
copies really expensive?

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:13.870
<i>I know everyone hates me deep down.</i>

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:11.200
Now! Hit him, hit him!

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:19.030
<i>But I love this feeling.</i>

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:21.830
<i>The feeling of having everything...</i>

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:26.110
<i>And the feeling of ignoring all of it.</i>

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:30.800
You'll pay for doing this to my child!

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:32.750
We're going to sue!

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:38.120
What's all this about, my sweet grandson?

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:46.280
Didn't Grandpa tell you to punch 
the trash until they're dead?

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.210
Don't worry.

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:53.440
If they die, Grandpa will 
do something about it.

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:56.010
I know.

00:18:56.370 --> 00:19:02.680
<i>This distance was born from their feeling 
of powerlessness approaching despair.</i>

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:58.050
Did you hear?

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:01.360
They guys he hit the other 
day haven't said a thing.

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:05.720
I heard some of them were 
killed by his family.

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:08.380
<i>It's not a gap that can be closed 
through hard work or luck.</i>

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:08.680
Who is he?

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:11.990
<i>The difference between me 
and you is our families.</i>

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:16.590
<i>Mine is a magnificently tall mountain.</i>

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:22.040
<i>I've been standing at its 
peak since I was born!</i>

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:25.600
<i>It's my right to have everything my way.</i>

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:29.560
<i>This world exists only for me!</i>

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:33.190
<i>So I want Ryuukonsei.</i>

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:35.330
<i>I want Tsuutenroku.</i>

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:37.270
<i>They're all mine!</i>

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:42.410
<i>So why do all these people 
keep getting in my way?</i>

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:46.810
<i>Why do these pieces of trash fight me?</i>

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:50.620
<i>It's all their fault!</i>

00:19:50.930 --> 00:19:52.300
<i>It's Fuu Shinton's fault!</i>

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:55.040
<i>He didn't hand over Ryuukonsei!</i>

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.610
<i>It's Chou Reigyoku's fault!</i>

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:59.380
<i>I just want Tsuutenroku!</i>

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.420
<i>It's that old fart Rikukin's fault!</i>

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:03.460
<i>He wouldn't give me Tsuutenroku!</i>

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:05.450
<i>It's Grandpa's fault!</i>

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:08.120
<i>He wouldn't get Tsuutenroku for me!</i>

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:12.250
<i>Why don't they see how much I'm hurting?</i>

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:31.410
This is... wrong...

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:35.750
It's all wrong...

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:42.920
Nothing in this world... 
should be able to defy me...

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:48.800
A world that defies me... 
